    },
    {
      "id": "claim_6d663175dbae4bcfa135cb70ebcf1362",
      "statement": "make db-backup, db-reset, db-clean and db-upgrade are local-only (guarded by require_local); for staging the Makefile directs users to make migrate ENV=staging and the provider's snapshots, so a staging backup is taken outside the Makefile.",
      "evidence": [
