      "id": "claim_48a9ac69352d44a3a4b26a310db581a5",
      "statement": "Schema changes go only in a new db/migrations/*.sql file (db/init/02_schema.sql is the fresh-database baseline); a new table needs RLS policies, reaching the Ask agent requires a line in backend/app/agent/tools/sql/catalog.py which is a security decision, and the migration must be recorded in docs/CHANGELOG.md and §7 in the same PR.",
